                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为促进新教师专业成长，夯实课堂教学基本功，9月17日，绍兴一中语文教研组在语文学科活动室开展了以“满月课教学设计汇报与评课”为主题的校本教研活动。本次活动聚焦高佳媛、童诗怡两位新教师的《拿来主义》同课异构教学展示，通过教学设计汇报、教师点评研讨、教学反思等多环节，实现以课促研、以研促教的目标</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。活动由教研组长谢澹主持，特别邀请了绍兴市语文教研员钱林波老师到会并作指导，语文组全体老师参加。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>课堂展示：同课异构见匠心</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\10\202510101638171280.Jpeg" style="width: 4.677778in; height: 3.090278in" alt="202510101638174201.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\10\202510101638175301.Jpeg" style="width: 4.511111in; height: 3.381944in" alt="202510101638179639.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高佳媛老师以鲁迅的杂文特点为切入点，通过三篇杂文对比，引导学生理解“针砭时弊、议论与文学性兼具”的文体特征。她巧妙运用表格梳理文中各类“主义”的危害、影响与作者态度，帮助学生快速把握文章逻辑，并以“文学家——思想家——革命家”为主线总结全文，展现扎实的文本解读功力。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">童诗怡老师则围绕“梳理关键词，理清脉络”展开教学，引导学生逐段分析“非拿来主义”现象，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过对</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">前七</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">段的论证结构是“先分后总”还是“层层递进”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深入探讨，引导学生理解鲁迅如何一步步引出“拿来主义”主张</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，体现了良好的教学能力。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>深度研讨：群策群力共提升</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在评课环节，多位教师从教学设计、课堂节奏、学生参与等角度展开深入点评</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\10\202510101638174467.Jpeg" style="width: 2.556944in; height: 2.102083in" alt="202510101638177012.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510101639276325.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510101639276325.jpg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">夏帅波老师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">赞赏</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">两位老师的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">跨篇目整合能力与细节处理</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">能力</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，同时提出拓展思考方向，引发对文化互鉴的深层思考，为新教师拓展了教学视野</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">洪波老师强调《拿来主义》对高一学生议论文写作的指导价值，肯定了两位教师对文本的深入解读，认为她们都注重学生基础能力的培养</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">副校长</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">朱水军认为</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">两位新教师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">展现了良好的专业素养</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同时，他也从教学经验出发，提出了课堂时间分配的建议。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\10\202510101638171913.Jpeg" style="width: 2.274306in; height: 2.1in" alt="202510101638173080.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/10/202510101638587547.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202510101638587547.png" /></p><p></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">钱林波</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">从教学设计的有效性出发，强调</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课后反思需紧扣目标是否落地</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他肯定</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">两位教师的课堂驾驭能力，教学基本功扎实</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">还就如何进一步突出教学重点分享了宝贵经验</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">建议两位教师及时复盘预设的教学目标，检视是否通过课堂活动有效达成</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">针对未达成的目标，需要及时调整教学设计，如简化冗余环节、强化重点任务。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">谢澹对本次活动作了小结，她认为新老师拥有良好的发展潜力，也精准指出了教学中存在的共性问题，提出在关键环节设置“留白时间”，增强“教学摩擦力”，给予学生试错和深思的机会。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>反思展望：以研促教助成长</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次活动不仅是对新教师教学能力的集中检阅，更是语文组教学理念的深度碰撞。通过“同课异构”模式，两位新教师展现出不同的教学风格与切入点，为经典文本的教学提供了多元思路。三尺讲台，一方教研。绍兴一中语文组将继续以课堂为主阵地，以教研为引擎，推动语文教学高质量发展。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;">
</p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
